GPU title kernels
-----------------

Quadrants (https://github.com/Genesis-Embodied-AI/quadrants)
  Role: the GPU kernel library the animated title screen renderer compiles
    against. It is a maintained fork of Taichi, which this project used until
    v0.80 and which is terminal upstream at 1.7.4.
  License: Apache-2.0
  Wheels (verified against PyPI for 1.3.0; no source distribution is published):
    Linux x86_64, Linux aarch64, macOS arm64 and Windows AMD64, Python 3.10-3.13
  Where there is no wheel (macOS x86_64, Python 3.14) the app renders title
    screens with Pillow instead: the same text and timing on a static gradient,
    without the animated kernels or the SDF text path. It is logged once at
    startup and reported by `immich-memories preflight`.

